{"title":"Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</b> (<b>JBMO</b>) is an annual contest for students under the age of 15.5 from one of the <a href=\"#Member_countries\">member countries</a> (Balkan area). In recent years the hosts have also invited some non-member guest countries.\n</p>\n<table style=\"border:thin solid black;padding:10px;float:right;margin:10px;background:#fff;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;text-align:center;background:#ccf;\"><b>JBMO</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Region</b>: Balkan Area\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Type</b>: Proof\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">Difficulty</a></b>: 4 - 6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Difficulty Breakdown:</b>\n<p><u>Problem 1</u>: 4<br /><u>Problem 2/3</u>: 5<br /><u>Problem 4</u>: 6\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Member_countries\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Member countries</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Albania\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Albania</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Bosnia_&amp;_Herzegovina\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Bulgaria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bulgaria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Cyprus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cyprus</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Hellas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hellas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Former_Yugoslav_Republic_of_Macedonia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Republic_of_Moldova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Republic of Moldova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Romania\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Romania</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Serbia_&amp;_Montenegro\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Serbia &amp; Montenegro</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Turkey\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Turkey</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Past_JBMOs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past JBMOs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Member_countries\">Member countries</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Member countries\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Albania\">Albania</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Albania\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span id=\"Bosnia_.26_Herzegovina\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bosnia_&amp;_Herzegovina\">Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bulgaria\">Bulgaria</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Bulgaria\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cyprus\">Cyprus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Cyprus\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions#Junior_high-school_(Gymnasium)_Competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">Junior high-school (Gymnasium) Maths Competitions in Cyprus</a>.</i>\n</p><p>In Cyprus <b>Four provincial competitions</b> and a <b>National (Pancyprian) competition</b> are held  every year. During this procedure 30 students are selected and Four <b>Team Selection Tests</b> are held to determine who will be the the six member of national team for JBMO\n</p>\n<ul><li>In every competition or test there are four problem usually covering <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">geometry</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Number_theory\" title=\"Number theory\">number theory</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra\" title=\"Algebra\">algebra</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinatorics\" title=\"Combinatorics\">combinatorics</a> (elementary level) and last four hours each.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hellas\">Hellas</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Hellas\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Θαλής (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Thales\" title=\"Thales\">Thalis</a>) - first round</li>\n<li>Ευκλείδης (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclides&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Euclides (page does not exist)\">Efklidis</a>) - second round</li>\n<li>Αρχιμήδης (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Archimedes\" title=\"Archimedes\">Archimidis</a>) - third round</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Former_Yugoslav_Republic_of_Macedonia\">Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Republic_of_Moldova\">Republic of Moldova</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Republic of Moldova\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Romania\">Romania</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Romania\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span id=\"Serbia_.26_Montenegro\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Serbia_&amp;_Montenegro\">Serbia &amp; Montenegro</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Serbia &amp; Montenegro\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Turkey\">Turkey</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Turkey\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_JBMOs\">Past JBMOs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Past JBMOs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO\" title=\"1997 JBMO\">1st JBMO</a> was held in Belgrade, Yugoslavia in 1997.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_JBMO\" title=\"1998 JBMO\">2nd JBMO</a> was held in Athens, Greece in 1998.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_JBMO\" title=\"1999 JBMO\">3rd JBMO</a> was held in Plovdiv, Bulgaria in 1999.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_JBMO\" title=\"2000 JBMO\">4th JBMO</a> was held in Ohrid, Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia (FYROM) in 2000.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_JBMO\" title=\"2001 JBMO\">5th JBMO</a> was held in Nicosia, Cyprus in 2001.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO\" title=\"2002 JBMO\">6th JBMO</a> was held in Târgu-Mureş, Romania in 2002.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_JBMO\" title=\"2003 JBMO\">7th JBMO</a> was held in İzmir, Turkey in 2003.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_JBMO\" title=\"2004 JBMO\">8th JBMO</a> was held in Novi Sad, Yugoslavia in 2004.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_JBMO\" title=\"2005 JBMO\">9th JBMO</a> was held in Veria, Greece on 20-26 June , 2005. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.hms.gr/jbmo2005/\">[1]</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_JBMO\" title=\"2006 JBMO\">10th JBMO</a> was held in Chişinău, Moldova on 25-30 June, 2006. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://dbsrv.asm.md/jbmo/\">[2]</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO\" title=\"2007 JBMO\">11th JBMO</a> was held in Shumen, Bulgaria on 25-30 June, 2007.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_JBMO\" title=\"2008 JBMO\">12th JBMO</a> was held in Vlorë, Albania on 23-28 June, 2008.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_JBMO\" title=\"2009 JBMO\">13th JBMO</a> was held in Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina on 25-30 June, 2009.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_JBMO\" title=\"2010 JBMO\">14th JBMO</a> was held in Olanesti, Vâlcea County, Romania on 18–22 June 2010.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_JBMO\" title=\"2011 JBMO\">15th JBMO</a> was held in Larnaca, Cyprus on 19–24 June 2011.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO\" title=\"2012 JBMO\">16th JBMO</a> was held in Veria, Greece on 25–29 June 2012.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_JBMO\" title=\"2013 JBMO\">17th JBMO</a> was held in Antalya, Turkey on 21–26 June 2013.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_JBMO\" title=\"2014 JBMO\">18th JBMO</a> was held in Ohrid, FYROM on 21–26 June 2014.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_JBMO\" title=\"2015 JBMO\">19th JBMO</a> was held in Belgrade, Serbia on 24–29 June 2015.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_JBMO\" title=\"2016 JBMO\">20th JBMO</a> was held in Slatina, Romania on 24–29 June 2016.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_JBMO\" title=\"2017 JBMO\">21st JBMO</a> was held in Varna, Bulgaria on 14-29 June 2017.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_JBMO\" title=\"2018 JBMO\">22nd JBMO</a> was held in Rhodes, Hellas on 19-24 June 2018.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018030402\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include 